# GD-24 (round 19, writer 10): settled; was REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §2.4. L §2.4: rules "then by their own governs as a version's rows are": a rule with no span of its own first.
# The old comment:
# L §2.4 sorts rules "by label, then by the known date of their v, a rule without v first, then by the start of their
# own governs"; where a rule with no governs of its own sorts against one of its label with one is not stated (the
# version items' "a row with no span of its own first" is said of version items only): REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED.
=== options reprint
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

def f: int
  rule a governs 2027.. = 2
  rule a = 1
